      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Terrible experience - while the solar panels are in and we have the Federal government rebate - the other parts of this process has been terrible. Promised community rebate by Ecosavers - hasn't happened; Promised a Goodwe inverter  - Solis inverter installed instead. Unsure about the solar panels installed compared to the pamphlet; We were promised high quality equipment but it is different to what was indicated. Promised to help us to get on the grid - my wife has done the running around; Promised to help us get the Victorian Government rebate now we find we should have applied for this and these are closed. There was no assistance or guidance from Storage and Solar on this and now we find they are not on the list of certified installers. Getting the state government rebate is very very doubtful. We believe we paid far too much for what we got and sorry cannot recommend Ecosavers/ Aus Solar/ Storage and Solar..",
