      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Had a Eco savers sales man come to my door, I asked him how much it would cost for a 20 panel 5 kw system to be installed. He said he didn't know, but he could book a consultant to come and tell me what I need and that he could give me a price.I said I have done my home work and that I know what I want. I told him that I have got quotes from a few other providers and wanted to compare. He gave me a card with the phone number on it and told me that they would be able to give me the pricesSo I called them and they said they don't know the prices and that only the consultants know the prices. I found this very odd that the head office couldn't give me a price. I visited there web site and found that it was very limited information on there. I searched the reviews and was amused by the review on their web site.Very shady Eco savers, I've learnt that if it walks like a duck and quacks like a duck it usually is a duck. Lmao at your sales techniques and poor customer service.",
